Vendored code: Magento/Mage-OS XML augmenter (augmenter/src/parsers/,
augmenter/src/resolvers/)

Source: mage-os-gitnexus/augmenter (github.com/ProxiBlue/mage-os-gitnexus,
private companion repo), originally written by Lucas van Staden /
Proxiblue and licensed MIT there.

Only the pure XML parsers (`parsers/di-xml.ts`, `parsers/layout-xml.ts`,
plus the parse-only `parseSingle*`/`find*Files` functions extracted from
`parsers/events-xml.ts`, `parsers/webapi-xml.ts`, `parsers/routes-xml.ts`)
and the path resolvers (`resolvers/psr4-map.ts`,
`resolvers/template-path.ts`) were vendored into this repository. The
GitNexus-coupled writer (`writer/lbug-writer.ts`), the filesystem-based
node-id resolver (`resolvers/node-id.ts`), and the XML-to-GitNexus-graph
mapper bodies (`*-mapper.ts` / `mapAndParse*` functions) were NOT vendored
— they are re-implemented from scratch against the codegraph SQLite schema
in this repository's own tasks 002/003/003b.

